algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: ExactMinCover(M)
  Input: Presheaf model M with objects, fibers, restrictions
  Output: Minimum cover size and witnessing cover

  generators ← all (object, element) pairs
  elements ← all (object, element) pairs
  coverage[g] ← {elements covered by g} for each g

  for size = 0, 1, ..., |generators|:
    for each subset S of generators with |S| = size:
      if ∪_{g ∈ S} coverage[g] = elements:
        return (size, S)

  Complexity: O(2^N · N · E) time, O(N) space
